stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> created
  created --> validated: inputs and manifest valid
  created --> invalid: validation failure
  validated --> running: owner acquired
  running --> paused: graceful pause/interruption
  paused --> running: resume and recovery
  running --> completed: all scenarios terminal
  running --> cancelled: cancellation completes
  running --> failed: harness integrity failure
  completed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  invalid --> [*]
